    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a single French developer passionate about video games.<br>A first-person horror thriller where every room could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/f0bb434632753d01902b4c19c51aad4b.poster.avif?t=1752835943\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/f0bb434632753d01902b4c19c51aad4b.webm?t=1752835943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/f0bb434632753d01902b4c19c51aad4b.mp4?t=1752835943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Investigation</strong> is a solo narrative horror game. <br> You play as a private detective sent to track down a missing person. What seemed like a simple case quickly turns into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/68e18ff9fade29ab63ade01d8ae5a600.poster.avif?t=1752835943\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/68e18ff9fade29ab63ade01d8ae5a600.webm?t=1752835943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/68e18ff9fade29ab63ade01d8ae5a600.mp4?t=1752835943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the unknown.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room holds a mystery. Every sound is a warning. <strong>Dark Investigation</strong> is a short but intense experience designed for horror fans.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a single French developer passionate about video games.<br>A first-person horror thriller where every room could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/f0bb434632753d01902b4c19c51aad4b.poster.avif?t=1752835943\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/f0bb434632753d01902b4c19c51aad4b.webm?t=1752835943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/f0bb434632753d01902b4c19c51aad4b.mp4?t=1752835943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Investigation</strong> is a solo narrative horror game. <br> You play as a private detective sent to track down a missing person. What seemed like a simple case quickly turns into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/68e18ff9fade29ab63ade01d8ae5a600.poster.avif?t=1752835943\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/68e18ff9fade29ab63ade01d8ae5a600.webm?t=1752835943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780600/extras/68e18ff9fade29ab63ade01d8ae5a600.mp4?t=1752835943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the unknown.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room holds a mystery. Every sound is a warning. <strong>Dark Investigation</strong> is a short but intense experience designed for horror fans.</p>",
